WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.501
Welcome, welcome, welcome to "The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.801
You're here. You made it.

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:07.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.701
What a show we have for you tonight.

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:11.934
The one and only Madonna is here tonight!

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.300
♪♪

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.167
And if that's not enough for you,

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:20.367
we have music and talk from Elvis Costello tonight!

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:23.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.834
That's right. Madonna and Elvis Costello.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.167
I got to say, going to the Rock &amp; Roll Hall of Fame is nice,

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.934
but it's even nicer when it comes to you.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:31.634
I mean, isn't that amazing?

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:32.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.367
Wow.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:39.033
Well, guys, the big news right now is that today,

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.167
while being questioned by the New York attorney general,

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:44.200
former President Trump chose to plead the fifth

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.267
just two days after the FBI searched Mar-a-lago.

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:50.367
And the big news on our show is that Madonna is on the show.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:51.968
So I...

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.434
I wanted to use one story to help break down the other.

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:57.434
This is "Headline Playlist: Madonna Edition."

00:00:57.434 --> 00:00:58.601
♪♪

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:03.033
-♪ Headline, Headline Playlist ♪

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:05.334
♪♪

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:08.734
-So, when it comes to legal trouble, Trump's not exactly

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.300
Like a Virgin.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.267
He's been accused of taking classified documents,

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:16.000
which isn't even... Borderline legal.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.200
So, on Monday, Merrick Garland said, "Give It 2 Me,"

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.968
and without even 4 Minutes warning,

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:24.300
he had the FBI Get Together

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.501
and raid Trump's safe at Mar-a-lago.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:29.000
Agents were like, "Where's the Material, Girl?"

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:36.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.067
Then in a deposition today, the New York attorney general's

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.133
office got Into The Groove and was like,

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.334
"Open Your Heart and Express Yourself."

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:46.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:50.767
To which Trump was like, "Papa, Don't Preach"...

00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:52.801
and en-Vogue-ed the fifth amendment.

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:56.501
Now, sounds like in either case, he'll have to face the Music,

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.434
or his assets will be Frozen

00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:01.167
and he'll be sent off on a nice long Holiday.

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:02.701
This has been

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:05.334
"Headline Playlist: Madonna Edition."

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:09.968
-♪ Headline, Headline Playlist ♪

00:02:09.968 --> 00:02:12.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.267
-That's right. Today, the New York attorney general

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:17.367
called Trump to answer questions under oath

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:18.868
about his business dealings,

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:21.000
but he decided to plead the fifth.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.601
Trump was like, "I'm not saying anything self-incriminating.

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.267
That's what my rallies are for."

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:31.501
In the past, Trump has said

00:02:31.501 --> 00:02:34.567
that only guilty people and mobsters plead the fifth.

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:37.534
To which the FBI said, "So...which one are you?"

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:39.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.601
And get this -- apparently the search warrant for Mar-a-lago

00:02:41.601 --> 00:02:44.534
was based on information from a confidential source

00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:47.300
who revealed what classified documents Trump still had

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.834
and where he was keeping them.

00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:50.868
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:50.868 --> 00:02:52.601
Right now Rudy Giuliani's thinking,

00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:54.667
"Oh, crap, did I butt-dial the FBI again?

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:58.400
Oh! This -- This keeps happening to me."

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.968
Yep, no one knows who it is, but Eric just started wearing

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:04.200
a pin that says "FBI's Little Helper."

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.434
-Aww.

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:09.601
-Yeah, Trump's having a rough week.

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:11.801
On top of the investigation into his business

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:13.701
and the FBI showing up at Mar-a-lago,

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:15.234
a federal court just ruled

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:17.934
that he has to hand over his tax returns to Congress.

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:24.400
Americans are like, "His taxes?

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.133
God, that was like ten scandals ago!

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:27.801
Keep up with the..."

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:30.033
At this point, there are more Trump investigations

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:32.767
than there are streaming platforms.

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:34.167
Did you guys see this?

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:36.467
Yesterday, Rudy Giuliani was supposed to testify in court

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:37.934
but got a doctor's note

00:03:37.934 --> 00:03:40.868
that said he wasn't cleared for air travel.

00:03:40.868 --> 00:03:43.400
So -- [ Laughs ] So the judge agreed

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.167
to delay his testimony until next week

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:48.367
but told Rudy that he must be there whether he has to travel

00:03:48.367 --> 00:03:53.667
on a train, on a bus, or "Uber or whatever."

00:03:53.667 --> 00:03:55.501
When they heard, every Uber driver was like,

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:58.067
"Please choose train or bus. Please choose train or bus.

00:03:58.067 --> 00:03:59.968
Please choose train or bus."

00:03:59.968 --> 00:04:02.167
Guys, I read that ahead of this year's midterms, Democrats

00:04:02.167 --> 00:04:04.767
are working with influencers and TikTok creators

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:07.634
to reach voters with party-sponsored content.

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:10.467
Yep, sounds like fun until you see Nancy Pelosi

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:13.133
smack Chuck Schumer in the face with a tortilla.

00:04:13.133 --> 00:04:14.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.667
"Way to ruin TikTok challenge." Yeah.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:23.767
Hey, I saw that cyber-security experts are warning

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:26.801
that North Korea is becoming more advanced at hacking people

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:29.734
and stealing their cryptocurrency.

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:31.667
Yeah, people who own Bitcoin right now are like,

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:33.501
"Please, take it."

00:04:33.501 --> 00:04:34.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:36.234
So if you lost a bunch of crypto,

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:38.601
it was either North Korean hackers or simply just because

00:04:38.601 --> 00:04:41.033
you put your money in crypto.

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:43.033
Well, I'm not sure about this -- there's a new drink

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.734
on the market that combines two very different things.

00:04:45.734 --> 00:04:47.033
Check this out.

00:04:47.033 --> 00:04:49.834
-It's called Protochol, and it's the world's first

00:04:49.834 --> 00:04:52.067
alcohol-spiked protein drink.

00:04:52.067 --> 00:04:54.634
The creator says he got the idea once he realized

00:04:54.634 --> 00:04:56.734
that he and his friends would go work out

00:04:56.734 --> 00:04:59.100
then they'd usually drink immediately after.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:04.434
-It's the perfect drink for when you need a burst of energy

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:06.133
to get through your intervention.

00:05:06.133 --> 00:05:07.467
You know what I'm saying?

00:05:07.467 --> 00:05:09.234
That's right. Protein and beer.

00:05:09.234 --> 00:05:11.033
I give it one week till this drink

00:05:11.033 --> 00:05:12.934
is elected mayor of the Jersey Shore.

00:05:12.934 --> 00:05:14.367
Just one -- one week.

00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:16.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:16.567 --> 00:05:19.434
♪♪

00:05:19.434 --> 00:05:21.467
[ Rasta horn blares ] Oh.

00:05:21.467 --> 00:05:24.100
-Snooki! -Ohh!

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:27.334
-Meanwhile, today, a truck in Kentucky that was hauling

00:05:27.334 --> 00:05:30.501
Bud Light crashed and spilled thousands of cans everywhere.

00:05:30.501 --> 00:05:32.000
Take a look at this.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.634
-Whoa. [ Audience oohs ]

00:05:33.634 --> 00:05:35.133
-Now, I only swam in it once,

00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:37.601
but that's pretty much what Post Malone's pool looks like.

00:05:37.601 --> 00:05:38.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:38.667 --> 00:05:40.033
That was breaking news, by the way.

00:05:40.033 --> 00:05:41.601
But if that happened to be Bud Light Lime,

00:05:41.601 --> 00:05:43.801
no one would have reported it. You know what I'm saying?

